{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>Outside</b> Three times in the Masorah: מן הבשר חוצה · הן אראלים צעקו חוצה · כי מגרעות נתן לבית סביב חוצה. The meaning: outside their houses the Holy One, blessed be He, diminished them and killed their firstborns; therefore they cried out outside. But inside, He did not allow the destroyer to enter; therefore 'you shall not take the meat outside' — so as not to go outside."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:42.281414546Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}